Package: mithrandir-rs
Version: 0.4.4
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Antonio <antonio@localhost>
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend
Recommends: papirus-icon-theme
Homepage: https://github.com/Antux912012/mithrandir-rs
Description: Native GTK4/Libadwaita System Cleaner, Hardware Power Saver & Telemetry in Rust
 Mithrandir-RS is a blazing-fast, Libadwaita-based GNU/Linux maintenance utility
 written in Rust. Features include instant one-click Smart Boost, real-time hardware
 and memory telemetry, parallel clutter cleanup, hardware-level power saving
 (Intel P-State CPU Turbo/EPP & PCIe ASPM), and pure Rust GNOME/KDE panel integration.
